			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">12.5.2023::10:47:59</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_text type="a">Read all status check has to be done in EcuAppMExt file via EcuAppM_ProcessJobStatus function.%0D
